<title>NEW ZEALAND: Underground backs Just Jeans bid.</title>
<headline>Underground backs Just Jeans bid.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Underground Fashions Ltd's independent director's report said on Wednesday the offer from Australia's Just Jeans was fair and reasonable.  </p>
<p>Just Jeans, through Kimbyr Investments Ltd, is offering 33.5 NZ cents per share for Underground.</p>
<p>Underground last traded at 34 NZ cents.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
